{"seq":1,"slug":"intensity-inverse-square","title":"光强与平方反比定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/light-physics/intensity-inverse-square","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"光强与平方反比定律\">光强与平方反比定律</h1><p>把一盏灯往后挪一步，照在脸上的亮度并不是「暗一点点」，而是骤然塌掉一截。很多人第一次用棚灯调曝光时都被这件事坑过：明明只挪了半米，测光表却掉了一档半。这背后是一条铁律——点光源的照度随距离的平方衰减。理解它，等于拿到了控制画面光比、背景明暗和景深关系的总开关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>光强（luminous intensity，单位坎德拉 cd）描述光源在某方向上发出的光通量密度，是光源自身的属性，不随距离改变。而真正决定底片曝光的是<strong>照度</strong>（illuminance，单位勒克斯 lux），即单位面积接收到的光通量。当一束光从点光源向外扩散，同样的光通量被摊在越来越大的球面上，球面面积按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi d^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增长，于是照度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 与距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的平方成反比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\frac{I}{d^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是光源在该方向的发光强度。这条关系只对<strong>点光源</strong>严格成立。当光源相对被摄体已经足够大（比如紧贴的大柔光箱），它更像面光源，衰减会比平方反比缓和——这一点在<a href=\"hard-soft-light\">硬光与柔光</a>里会展开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[点光源 I] --&gt; B[距离 d&lt;br/&gt;照度 E = I / d²]&#10;    A --&gt; C[距离 2d&lt;br/&gt;照度 E/4]&#10;    A --&gt; D[距离 3d&lt;br/&gt;照度 E/9]&#10;    B --&gt; E[实拍含义&lt;br/&gt;挪远一倍 = 暗两档]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n    A[点光源 I] --&gt; B[距离 d&lt;br/&gt;照度 E = I / d²]\n    A --&gt; C[距离 2d&lt;br/&gt;照度 E/4]\n    A --&gt; D[距离 3d&lt;br/&gt;照度 E/9]\n    B --&gt; E[实拍含义&lt;br/&gt;挪远一倍 = 暗两档]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>距离倍数</th>\n<th>照度比例</th>\n<th>曝光变化（档/EV）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1.0×</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.4×</td>\n<td>51%</td>\n<td>−1 EV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.0×</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>−2 EV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.8×</td>\n<td>13%</td>\n<td>−3 EV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4.0×</td>\n<td>6.25%</td>\n<td>−4 EV</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意一个反直觉之处：距离翻倍只对应 2 档而非 4 档。因为曝光档数是以 2 为底的对数尺度，照度变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/4</span></span></span></span></span> 正好是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 4 = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从平方反比推导光比与背景控制\">从平方反比推导光比与背景控制</h2><p>平方反比定律最实用的地方，是它让「主体和背景的相对亮度」变得可计算。假设灯离主体 1 米、离背景墙 3 米。主体处照度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I/1^2 = I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，墙面处是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I/3^2 = I/9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\">/9</span></span></span></span></span>，相差约 3.2 档。也就是说，只要灯靠近主体，背景就会自然压暗——这是压黑背景最省事的办法，不需要额外的黑旗。</p>\n<p>反过来，如果想要背景和主体同样明亮（比如证件照式的均匀照明），就得把灯拉远。灯在 5 米和 5.5 米处的照度差只有约 0.3 档，主体与背景几乎一致。一句话：<strong>光源越近，光比越陡、衰减越凶；光源越远，画面越平、越均匀。</strong></p>\n<p>这也解释了为什么影室里「贴脸打光」能轻松做出明暗对比强烈的低调效果，而新闻发布会的远距离顶光把所有人都照得一样平。低调与均匀照明的审美取舍，留到<a href=\"../lighting-setups/high-key-low-key\">高调与低调布光</a>里细谈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"闪光指数与平方反比的同一性\">闪光指数与平方反比的同一性</h2><p>闪光灯的「闪光指数」（Guide Number, GN）本质上就是平方反比定律的另一种写法。GN 把光源强度、距离和光圈绑在一起：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext>-number</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GN = f\\text{-number} \\times d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GN</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-number</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在 ISO 100 下，若某灯 GN = 56（米制），主体在 7 米处，则正确光圈为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>56</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">56 / 7 = f/8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">56/7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span></span></span></span></span>。把主体挪到 14 米，光圈得开到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>56</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">56/14 = f/4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">56/14</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/4</span></span></span></span></span>——开大两档，正好补偿距离翻倍带来的 2 档损失。可见 GN 公式里的距离是一次方，但因为光圈每开一档进光量翻倍（面积尺度），换算到照度仍是平方关系，逻辑自洽。GN 的器材细节和实际标称陷阱，见<a href=\"../lighting-gear/flash-strobe\">闪光灯与频闪</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测光实践-用衰减做造型\">测光实践：用衰减做造型</h2><p>熟练的布光师不会死记公式，而是用平方反比来「设计衰减」。几个常用手法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>羽化（feathering）</strong>：不让光源正对主体，而是让光的边缘扫过主体。配合衰减，可以在一张脸上做出从亮到暗的连续过渡，比硬调整光比更自然。</li>\n<li><strong>近灯压背景</strong>：人像外拍时把灯贴近模特，背景的环境光因衰减而相对变暗，主体被「从环境里拎出来」。</li>\n<li><strong>群拍布距</strong>：拍多人合影时，前后排距离差会因平方反比放大成可见的曝光差。解决办法是把灯拉远，让前后排的相对距离差缩小。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[想要的画面效果] --&gt; B{光比陡还是平?}&#10;    B --&gt;|陡 / 戏剧性| C[灯贴近主体&lt;br/&gt;背景自然压暗]&#10;    B --&gt;|平 / 均匀| D[灯拉远&lt;br/&gt;前后排曝光一致]&#10;    C --&gt; E[低调 · 单灯造型]&#10;    D --&gt; F[高调 · 多人合影]\">graph TD\n    A[想要的画面效果] --&gt; B{光比陡还是平?}\n    B --&gt;|陡 / 戏剧性| C[灯贴近主体&lt;br/&gt;背景自然压暗]\n    B --&gt;|平 / 均匀| D[灯拉远&lt;br/&gt;前后排曝光一致]\n    C --&gt; E[低调 · 单灯造型]\n    D --&gt; F[高调 · 多人合影]</pre><h2 id=\"实测中的偏差与修正\">实测中的偏差与修正</h2><p>真实世界里照度很少严格遵守 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/d^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，主要有三类偏差：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>光源非理想点源</strong>：柔光箱、反光伞这类大面积光源在近距离时衰减明显慢于平方反比，只有距离远到光源张角变小，才逐渐回归点源行为。</li>\n<li><strong>反射环境补光</strong>：白墙、天花板会把光二次反射回主体，相当于叠加了若干衰减更慢的二级光源，使阴影区不至于全黑。</li>\n<li><strong>光源带聚光附件</strong>：加了蜂巢、菲涅尔透镜或反光碗后，光束被收拢，光不再向全 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 立体角扩散，沿光轴方向的衰减会比裸灯慢得多。这类附件的造型差异见<a href=\"../lighting-gear/softbox-modifiers\">柔光箱与改光附件</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>实拍时与其计算，不如带一支测光表（或用相机直方图）在主体位置和背景位置各测一次，直接读出真实光比，再用平方反比的直觉去微调灯位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>照度随距离平方衰减：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = I/d^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；距离翻倍掉 2 档，而非 4 档。</li>\n<li>灯近则光比陡、背景暗、衰减快；灯远则画面平、均匀、衰减慢。</li>\n<li>闪光指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GN = f \\times d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GN</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是平方反比定律的器材化表达。</li>\n<li>平方反比是「压暗背景」「控制前后排曝光」的物理依据，可主动设计。</li>\n<li>大面积光源、反射环境、聚光附件都会让实测偏离理想平方反比，最终以测光表读数为准。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光强与平方反比定律","id":"光强与平方反比定律"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从平方反比推导光比与背景控制","id":"从平方反比推导光比与背景控制"},{"level":2,"text":"闪光指数与平方反比的同一性","id":"闪光指数与平方反比的同一性"},{"level":2,"text":"测光实践：用衰减做造型","id":"测光实践-用衰减做造型"},{"level":2,"text":"实测中的偏差与修正","id":"实测中的偏差与修正"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"硬光与柔光","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/light-physics/hard-soft-light"}}